WEBVTT

00:07:25.454 --> 00:07:33.996
Well, Mike became alpha male, but being
an alpha doesn't make you a leader.

00:07:33.996 --> 00:07:39.163
It makes you the boss. And others
will be submissive to you

00:07:39.829 --> 00:07:42.204
and greet you with submissive gestures,

00:07:42.913 --> 00:07:45.704
but then other males are
leaders and leaders

00:07:45.704 --> 00:07:52.288
because they're much more gentle and
other chimps like to follow them

00:07:52.288 --> 00:07:53.871
and choose to follow them.

00:07:54.538 --> 00:07:57.163
Oh, this is so fascinating. I have
so many questions for you.

00:07:57.163 --> 00:07:59.371
I'm not even sure where to start, I guess.

00:07:59.371 --> 00:08:03.621
So I'll start at the question of who
becomes a leader versus who's